{
  "flow": "proactive",
  "about": [
    "The messages the bot sends first. Graded on the text, because that is all the user sees:",
    "does it open like a person, say one thing, quote only facts it was given, and never claim",
    "a schedule nobody told it. The trigger's precondition is not re-run: each case states the",
    "facts the precondition would have produced. Times are Asia/Dubai."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "no_first_meal_without_a_known_wake_time",
      "tags": ["silence", "assumed-facts"],
      "note": "Real: 'три часа как встал' at 11:00, to a user who gets up at 9:30 and was never asked.",
      "now": "2026-09-22T11:00:00+04:00",
      "message": "",
      "expect": {
        "fire": {
          "trigger": "no_first_meal",
          "step": 1,
          "facts": { "wake_time": "08:00", "wake_time_assumed": true, "meals": 0, "kcal": 0 }
        },
        "sends": true,
        "text_not_matches": ["час.{0,12}как встал", "с (?:восьми|8)", "три часа"],
        "max_lines": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "no_dinner_says_one_thing",
      "tags": ["silence"],
      "note": "Real: 'последний раз ел в 16:17, до тренировки после неё уже 4 часа' - two facts glued into a relation the data did not state.",
      "now": "2026-09-22T21:00:00+04:00",
      "seed": {
        "meals": [
          { "at": "16:13", "slot": "lunch", "items": [{ "name": "salmon plate", "kcal": 905, "protein_g": 88, "carbs_g": 24, "fat_g": 32, "fiber_g": 7 }] }
        ]
      },
      "message": "",
      "expect": {
        "fire": {
          "trigger": "no_dinner",
          "step": 1,
          "facts": { "last_meal_at": "16:13", "kcal": 905, "protein_g": 88, "protein_target": 210 }
        },
        "sends": true,
        "text_not_matches": ["тренировк", "трен[ыи]", "workout"],
        "max_lines": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "protein_check_names_the_fix",
